ttps://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"0e8a780e2dfea2e22ac44545a16279dbe30eb8ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0e8a780e2dfea2e22ac44545a16279dbe30eb8ee","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0e8a780e2dfea2e22ac44545a16279dbe30eb8ee"}]},{"sha":"0e8a780e2dfea2e22ac44545a16279dbe30eb8ee","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDBlOGE3ODBlMmRmZWEyZTIyYWM0NDU0NWExNjI3OWRiZTMwZWI4ZWU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-01T21:46:19Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-01T21:46:19Z"},"message":"fix(code): reduce OAuth login modal noise (#3693)\n\nOAuth login in the TUI now keeps the happy path focused on the browser\nhandoff instead of dumping the full authorization URL into the modal.\nManual authorization is still available for fallback cases, and terminal\nsuccess states are cleaned up so users do not see duplicate or truncated\nlog output.\n\n## Changes\n- Hide the raw OAuth authorize URL when\n`MCPLoginScreen.show_authorize_url` successfully opens a browser,\nreplacing it with a collapsed \"Having trouble? Show manual authorization\nURL\" affordance.\n- Add keyboard support for the manual URL fallback via `Enter`,\nalongside click-to-toggle behavior, with footer help text that reflects\nwhether the URL is currently shown.\n- Move the OAuth waiting spinner out of the modal title and into the\n`Status:` line, so the title remains stable while browser authorization\nis pending.\n- Reveal the authorize URL again when loopback OAuth falls back after\ntimeout or callback-server unavailability by retaining the last\ngenerated URL in `_make_loopback_handlers`.\n- Clean up success rendering by hiding stale authorize fallback UI,\nsuppressing the history pane for clean success states, skipping\nduplicate consecutive history lines, and allowing history entries to\nwrap when they are shown.","tree":{"sha":"008e9cedf7314ebf26f8fce3f51ac4653c9b6dc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/008e9cedf7314ebf26f8fce3f51ac4653c9b6dc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/0e8a780e2dfea2e22ac44545a16279dbe30eb8ee","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHf2rCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEu8QAE4cDCQHDiTJF7iAhtmdS7wv\n0thgXWlDYoKWMUCI8tsMdKvi8JEB+oYmb5vDyeRE4EjAA25Pf1cNOnJjbcU/3dK7\niRJSqd0ZBZkMgIWmhuC2AYRsLGEPqmvVmudbnzvM7sYUlQWR+5gdve9Dz+dxriz9\nzEnw9dkL9/vYX3vWVZ+glNLB8RAt/TgGOqS3PnYgGrb3OM9JL72nV9FSJyzMpz85\nrERZz/EDufGZglKhJuPRmPtULCsUs1eg3kufIwURIpZVBHGtnYNx/gnrEEiePvHJ\nz1efKmIia7lv5tRBkBeebMSDQH7fI3YpI0uk4wAJsOmYuavgTonAC+gSMWZZfRmd\nh4wZVhl6IzIAQp3zYmHRrF1HSI6LB65LWsdrtt3hXWnHXp1bvz7vwC43SdIBkgcY\nq5OnzeK3XTg+gNvhsXd83m7Jm7muaCyPIcsIbTkgPT5LcBigLmBzIGfwDlesm6k4\nriC7CPhsVOxM4ByIQw9t9G77v0b3CRwCcBvMvnC6tFWhlPnd+HTzmXXOo5V/xs00\n/KGrz43hKKE7rOtIISGMNqdjlOETXmb/LzRdx0M/EFox+ibtqBW3Ujn2h2Q2uf1H\nNZEvVYxoWyXaXLw88rF/Ds9N9AI/Ui0+EjVsm52rTX/PoHjObKRFLAt3ADeS+98U\n+pmR1xJy9H+NrrjnsMds\n=dzjy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 008e9cedf7314ebf26f8fce3f51ac4653c9b6dc9\nparent b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1780350379 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780350379 -0400\n\nfix(code): reduce OAuth login modal noise (#3693)\n\nOAuth login in the TUI now keeps the happy path focused on the browser\nhandoff instead of dumping the full authorization URL into the modal.\nManual authorization is still available for fallback cases, and terminal\nsuccess states are cleaned up so users do not see duplicate or truncated\nlog output.\n\n## Changes\n- Hide the raw OAuth authorize URL when\n`MCPLoginScreen.show_authorize_url` successfully opens a browser,\nreplacing it with a collapsed \"Having trouble? Show manual authorization\nURL\" affordance.\n- Add keyboard support for the manual URL fallback via `Enter`,\nalongside click-to-toggle behavior, with footer help text that reflects\nwhether the URL is currently shown.\n- Move the OAuth waiting spinner out of the modal title and into the\n`Status:` line, so the title remains stable while browser authorization\nis pending.\n- Reveal the authorize URL again when loopback OAuth falls back after\ntimeout or callback-server unavailability by retaining the last\ngenerated URL in `_make_loopback_handlers`.\n- Clean up success rendering by hiding stale authorize fallback UI,\nsuppressing the history pane for clean success states, skipping\nduplicate consecutive history lines, and allowing history entries to\nwrap when they are shown.","verified_at":"2026-06-01T21:46:19Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0e8a780e2dfea2e22ac44545a16279dbe30eb8ee","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0e8a780e2dfea2e22ac44545a16279dbe30eb8ee","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0e8a780e2dfea2e22ac44545a16279dbe30eb8ee/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7"}]},{"sha":"b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGIxYTVlYmY3NWZkYWRjM2QyZGQyNmUzYWJmY2ExNDUyNDgwOWZiZTc","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-01T21:44:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-01T21:44:26Z"},"message":"release(langchain-quickjs): 0.1.3 (#3371)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/langchain-quickjs==0.1.2...langchain-quickjs==0.1.3)\n(2026-06-01)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* Add REPL persistence modes\n([#3557](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3557))\n([0cda6f3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a))\n* Add swarm task tool\n([#3472](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3472))\n([2c28b7b](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2c28b7b8c2ac7571fc3a1f0d8d00f5697fe3e90e))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Auto-await final-expression Promise in eval REPL\n([#3499](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3499))\n([f7f894a](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f7f894aa9f313cf8157bc6d7711013f5509d0b46))\n* Scope REPL prompt sandbox bullet to the runtime\n([#3528](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3528))\n([1b395ab](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1b395ab9699b1f384a85efeeef732ea7e4fc523a))\n* Update system prompt snapshots\n([#3450](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3450))\n([9f9220d](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9f9220d80737208faa9262c0bdfb3eeafc0e13c8))\n* Stable `HumanMessage` IDs across resumed threads\n([#3591](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3591))\n([82c3194](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/82c31947f9dc938ffc71e1cea96d162a39aec3a1))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Colin Francis <colin.francis@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"c2b85b1e9a8f8eadee73f80a2c55af439f8079b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c2b85b1e9a8f8eadee73f80a2c55af439f8079b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHf06CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADbUQAKtTBK16jaLNbA/Z4bbpbXSU\nBJ8HmqQ+MH/ojzOolNBFbzirz6l6sFhNeWFa8tskwqwqSnfxRZGH/e6GqETM5Vnz\niqecUXVYqctRSXaToJn4pkELcf4aUzrHVsPLKw7ohjln1BsEwnCNIy3QcPbynV15\nxttvqiuXyz4o8g9PHxPxlZ461qwxR+edgtk0nqmG5n4csNvEmEaFQ5JpAgXa58CZ\nmoAzjSKjsrxljNRldg64ZegFVODZxvfi9Xgvo0mBxxO/v4Eo7ztDg+ggDY6wQJQV\nF8yXovwTODFnvoxQs1LpDfJ8UPA/sgn5nDquZJo4Tf5G7+2k919Mt2lZ782PQIIS\nm89TyagUAFu3LzH/tm3XU68x9PjaoPBRZt6E5EVrgKH9eK8sMqNimqWdb63dqhEA\ne5MT5GJEre6AsV+VAXeDCffSHTmLqHFon34H+BGjr8nl1mnVmcyiEQA9LiQKLXPA\nnH9608UExk8+F7sEYsWhoU1JNfbg9BO+JMX/ceHEVLpPvP/ocPXhLgpstKh2drZN\njEy36DfWW0GJPZSQD3HQkGXlyJsxi6ZRb+pGyR557HHwV6e2Nn6qujm1W8NlVVLA\npbNFHl1I+uqxYYcuaXAE+gZtBuHjI7823WPpyMQeaDcXuSnS9wpJn+2ha7+7YSaj\nZE3lldPmLleQTTpHmMHa\n=eqx9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c2b85b1e9a8f8eadee73f80a2c55af439f8079b3\nparent 0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780350266 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780350266 -0400\n\nrelease(langchain-quickjs): 0.1.3 (#3371)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/langchain-quickjs==0.1.2...langchain-quickjs==0.1.3)\n(2026-06-01)\n\n\n### Features\n\n* Add REPL persistence modes\n([#3557](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3557))\n([0cda6f3](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a))\n* Add swarm task tool\n([#3472](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3472))\n([2c28b7b](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/2c28b7b8c2ac7571fc3a1f0d8d00f5697fe3e90e))\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Auto-await final-expression Promise in eval REPL\n([#3499](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3499))\n([f7f894a](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f7f894aa9f313cf8157bc6d7711013f5509d0b46))\n* Scope REPL prompt sandbox bullet to the runtime\n([#3528](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3528))\n([1b395ab](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1b395ab9699b1f384a85efeeef732ea7e4fc523a))\n* Update system prompt snapshots\n([#3450](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3450))\n([9f9220d](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9f9220d80737208faa9262c0bdfb3eeafc0e13c8))\n* Stable `HumanMessage` IDs across resumed threads\n([#3591](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3591))\n([82c3194](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/82c31947f9dc938ffc71e1cea96d162a39aec3a1))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Colin Francis <colin.francis@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-06-01T21:44:26Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/b1a5ebf75fdadc3d2dd26e3abfca14524809fbe7/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a"}]},{"sha":"0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDBjZGE2ZjNhYjI4YmM4M2NkMTZlYzlmY2M0ODIyOWJkZjZmMmRjMWE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Hunter Lovell","email":"40191806+hntrl@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-01T21:12:57Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-01T21:12:57Z"},"message":"feat(quickjs): add REPL persistence modes (#3557)\n\n## Summary\n\nCloses #3521\n\nThis updates `langchain-quickjs` to use explicit `mode`-driven REPL\npersistence messaging and behavior, and aligns middleware/runtime\nhandling for `thread`, `turn`, and `call` modes. It also deprecates\n`snapshot_between_turns`\n\n## Changes\n\n### `libs/partners/quickjs/langchain_quickjs`\n\n- Moved eval-tool prompt text/rendering to `_prompt.py` mode-based\nhelpers and updated middleware to consume those helpers.\n- Kept persistence normalization in `_resolve_persistence_flags`,\nincluding compatibility/deprecation handling for\n`snapshot_between_turns`.\n- Simplified `_repl.py` back to the `_ThreadREPL`/`_Slot`/`_Registry`\nmodel, while adding `reset_repl(thread_id)` to support `mode=\"call\"`\nreset semantics without recreating runtime/worker.\n- Updated middleware eval flow to:\n  - install PTC tools before call-mode evals when needed,\n  - run eval,\n  - then reset REPL for call mode in `finally`.\n\n### Tests and snapshots\n\n- Added dedicated mode prompt unit coverage in\n`tests/unit_tests/test_prompt_modes.py`.\n- Expanded smoke prompt snapshots to cover `thread`, `turn`, and `call`\nmodes in `tests/unit_tests/smoke_tests/test_system_prompt.py` and added\nthe new mode snapshot files.\n- Updated middleware/PTC tests for mode semantics and reset behavior in\n`test_repl_middleware.py` and `test_ptc.py`.\n\n### Docs\n\n- Updated `libs/partners/quickjs/README.md` to remove references to\n`snapshot_between_turns` and describe persistence in terms of `mode`\nonly.","tree":{"sha":"c4c3cc65902d3592b2f9cbdd16d293776cf5d8d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c4c3cc65902d3592b2f9cbdd16d293776cf5d8d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHfXZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHigQAHH803XecxShmwjnuc9//o/q\n8x6Jobm3AvGTvG60pvJATw2MyN07uTZM1z75gfwSUOk6XOiV0csNV5OPzwnE93/9\nYQnCEwF5V7LZMoIcVHKzpr099sdhsI4e01UJ4OR9HMXQVjxLV6HiA5oHwOMJNJzA\nv0cwnqMm/0+Yk0O1nrCM8HuyCZSR4gLjR4lLQ1J+2XB9nF7orOVzA2bIyC7dKwRc\nYCvdk7POV//3sL1fB9TSx+BfU7JW7k+w6Kt9z2kiHdabFWYnOvQYk/oJmEVuSJNz\n6k2HHxe5r2/S6c6EZQkmLn75bUatlAWjqug+bqUs8oBYaWR8rirMcclgSqXi8MZT\nxoHOpabm/vt/85FdbDTPLefEAwahbAN9Wk5kSJ/qYnV/XOl6zjliTk97MyDgnk4+\nzTFGMg38RQAc/kKtb00w2uf4ewInXK04AOR7jsOJXPzhuePNVNpw1vHWnKNt7EVQ\nHU0/1O8QvZi/RLsiihsMyvprZdcssXcvNCMSAATzxpdqa+HLeetZZHXSU+WtweVF\nKdVo8dUUzUmzBODBsV6+4VyBON17zen9HxBijLDuY/AIpLIv8j8qPtQvBdpyJ655\n3w4LUvFmUTosKMQ0cdf/q5iFoPu/5ESmukHdBYdYASK1wwR/T5pApLc3AfhDNayK\nkXr1HT26+3S+LN0k2kvI\n=xwen\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c4c3cc65902d3592b2f9cbdd16d293776cf5d8d9\nparent f741293524f7d47eb8a16a3cd4def336c3c3c13f\nauthor Hunter Lovell <40191806+hntrl@users.noreply.github.com> 1780348377 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780348377 -0700\n\nfeat(quickjs): add REPL persistence modes (#3557)\n\n## Summary\n\nCloses #3521\n\nThis updates `langchain-quickjs` to use explicit `mode`-driven REPL\npersistence messaging and behavior, and aligns middleware/runtime\nhandling for `thread`, `turn`, and `call` modes. It also deprecates\n`snapshot_between_turns`\n\n## Changes\n\n### `libs/partners/quickjs/langchain_quickjs`\n\n- Moved eval-tool prompt text/rendering to `_prompt.py` mode-based\nhelpers and updated middleware to consume those helpers.\n- Kept persistence normalization in `_resolve_persistence_flags`,\nincluding compatibility/deprecation handling for\n`snapshot_between_turns`.\n- Simplified `_repl.py` back to the `_ThreadREPL`/`_Slot`/`_Registry`\nmodel, while adding `reset_repl(thread_id)` to support `mode=\"call\"`\nreset semantics without recreating runtime/worker.\n- Updated middleware eval flow to:\n  - install PTC tools before call-mode evals when needed,\n  - run eval,\n  - then reset REPL for call mode in `finally`.\n\n### Tests and snapshots\n\n- Added dedicated mode prompt unit coverage in\n`tests/unit_tests/test_prompt_modes.py`.\n- Expanded smoke prompt snapshots to cover `thread`, `turn`, and `call`\nmodes in `tests/unit_tests/smoke_tests/test_system_prompt.py` and added\nthe new mode snapshot files.\n- Updated middleware/PTC tests for mode semantics and reset behavior in\n`test_repl_middleware.py` and `test_ptc.py`.\n\n### Docs\n\n- Updated `libs/partners/quickjs/README.md` to remove references to\n`snapshot_between_turns` and describe persistence in terms of `mode`\nonly.","verified_at":"2026-06-01T21:12:57Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0cda6f3ab28bc83cd16ec9fcc48229bdf6f2dc1a/comments","author":{"login":"hntrl","id":40191806,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTkxODA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40191806?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl","html_url":"https://github.com/hntrl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hntrl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f741293524f7d47eb8a16a3cd4def336c3c3c13f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f741293524f7d47eb8a16a3cd4def336c3c3c13f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f741293524f7d47eb8a16a3cd4def336c3c3c13f"}]},{"sha":"f741293524f7d47eb8a16a3cd4def336c3c3c13f","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGY3NDEyOTM1MjRmN2Q0N2ViOGExNmEzY2Q0ZGVmMzM2YzNjM2MxM2Y","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-01T19:33:23Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-01T19:33:23Z"},"message":"fix(code): repair MCP OAuth login redirect and stale client registration (#3692)\n\nTwo distinct bugs broke MCP OAuth login (e.g. Slack, LangSmith), both\nsurfacing as a cryptic `ExceptionGroup` / `unhandled errors in a\nTaskGroup`. The first made every login crash before reaching the\nbrowser; the second rejected DCR logins with `invalid or missing\nredirect_uri` when a stale client registration was reused.","tree":{"sha":"10a5184dd16bc58c0c334805609aa9a0780b8d25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/10a5184dd16bc58c0c334805609aa9a0780b8d25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f741293524f7d47eb8a16a3cd4def336c3c3c13f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcB