s/commit/bbeb869e2f9870ccdf93987e8bd0ad6ba2bef05c"}]},{"sha":"bbeb869e2f9870ccdf93987e8bd0ad6ba2bef05c","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGJiZWI4NjllMmY5ODcwY2NkZjkzOTg3ZThiZDBhZDZiYTJiZWYwNWM","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-05-30T04:38:42Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-30T04:38:42Z"},"message":"release(deepagents): 0.6.7 (#3654)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.6.7](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents==0.6.6...deepagents==0.6.7)\n(2026-05-30)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Propagate goto and graph in Commands returned by tools\n([#3391](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3391))\n([d92aef6](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d92aef68f70a5e5277c43a50581e7895e682c417))\n* Handle base64 reads with unknown file extensions\n([#3663](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3663))\n([9857a08](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9857a08b6144b2f001d8f4bf03ac2f254c6b2da4))\n* Export `DeepAgentState`\n([#3653](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3653))\n([14a9047](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/14a904757c2d9d797945b6ea1bc9529f1f8cf369))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"6207f4850dc51c55775b33506a2cdddcd6cdb49a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/6207f4850dc51c55775b33506a2cdddcd6cdb49a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/bbeb869e2f9870ccdf93987e8bd0ad6ba2bef05c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGmnSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAue8QAKqgNRk7tkfxKQaWxzzLP4Er\nOJ0u4K8RFOlShDIoYylXT8GgxdADgBsKkiXAx8cVbnVj6Gp4aQwBJ86eUZiBQEHj\nHQpYVFCX0/xUTn2Zbmz4lxQISF7Xm5XUsk6rLdxJNoQrUXSD+/PdUBZ1B+RS1JWj\nh5sJyvnIuJ4wZUiZY1ypO1fkL3TU30rqVbbDWbXbyaFy3kb4MU9uLfjuTGWLADwd\nIkHNyCfSeyxIFLPvWgkb66MfPukb8hlntIMzwJOhWwvgNKv85Ffsqs7B3xtBhfFT\nov5wu4nMR+mzqO0wwdW/5Q/EGfLiLxmGhoDIOY8EgnfbHoDeXueE1QDbyr3KykFw\nyUXwzyUNQCviyhyGrN+Xo7MR8u6AO43bRaWvt27alZdxA+7QtXIK/GZEZNoQyxE9\nICUpKTJdanKU9E7Kia9kNeUsMa5WOFO6IxAtFJjoTBG0yLXRtgyeQ5kOg+95E92H\nN2HZN5IcLN1amGD6M2YSW0It9vOTrHoex7o/DV1Q2GBwuYZyCRjNUTLPasvUojc2\nXaC9Wl7tyycB5cn36+9BgqznTUAIcYbhOuCa11J5ZMjRqKeWj3v37zZfrKB3ZvmZ\ndJ+n4GAd3l67yUM2CbgYAR2onN9FL5omc+YsdLCpuAXm9ShF5LkIn6cwZ7q6WSmo\nBRARjTTIcFBk73jiqqHk\n=xLXS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6207f4850dc51c55775b33506a2cdddcd6cdb49a\nparent 39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1780115922 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780115922 -0400\n\nrelease(deepagents): 0.6.7 (#3654)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.6.7](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents==0.6.6...deepagents==0.6.7)\n(2026-05-30)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Propagate goto and graph in Commands returned by tools\n([#3391](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3391))\n([d92aef6](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d92aef68f70a5e5277c43a50581e7895e682c417))\n* Handle base64 reads with unknown file extensions\n([#3663](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3663))\n([9857a08](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9857a08b6144b2f001d8f4bf03ac2f254c6b2da4))\n* Export `DeepAgentState`\n([#3653](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3653))\n([14a9047](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/14a904757c2d9d797945b6ea1bc9529f1f8cf369))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-05-30T04:38:42Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bbeb869e2f9870ccdf93987e8bd0ad6ba2bef05c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bbeb869e2f9870ccdf93987e8bd0ad6ba2bef05c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bbeb869e2f9870ccdf93987e8bd0ad6ba2bef05c/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb"}]},{"sha":"39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDM5YTUyOTg2NDNmZWYwOWI5OTJiMGU5NjdmZWE3NTIxMDY1YjVmYmI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-30T04:35:19Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-30T04:35:19Z"},"message":"style(code): align multi-line tool output that indents every row (#3670)\n\nCommand output where every line carries the same leading indent — `git\nbranch -r` prefixes each branch with two spaces — rendered with the\nfirst line flush against the glyph gutter and the remaining lines\nindented, because the output was passed through `str.strip()`, which\nonly trims the first line's leading whitespace. The collapsed preview\nand the expanded view stripped at different points, so expanding \"fixed\"\nthe misalignment while the default preview stayed crooked.","tree":{"sha":"b791e896245677e245a6a2d39b49146531aaaf1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/b791e896245677e245a6a2d39b49146531aaaf1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGmkHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1NcQAE5fjFDUWEhxV6uzIbMB1TqA\nGcKI5c46KKGJlJ0/EGL+Xs5CWopiAI/7ejTI+4ILxV0nEXEe1NBv9nh8ZUmf+hbZ\n9WgvJSI3dh+QvB/KjOv87Qv5k1h8h0VnzlLXFODHKozBL9V9dgj34An9WCN+pJdO\nGKSezmMC8ZuZhVtqsL8gDkF9OmXc+HgIGyJoJ4tcCKmPv+NYmSqohyy4cWb1LzrQ\nC9bYYI9krcol/iSOp7IRBfh+W1sNHB6EI0KjWxHofRFif4lKhIwL0Psdzd+gQ0C9\nsV1dv+Bo15SMOBejfBQ1MfTgrkkN21BsTJWl+PgOC2+Nb+ZItV04GVR6dPmd6EYG\nAMD6tYZP2vFH//dotb+jn6aDILs4dQSMSdyoQkBVxKxPSMRoYLWSxGjbqdzfg/oy\nvF4qkJgzJA7IgDxGRg1S1206eV86F2ZvRCfjR0wklZYjGDlEvaNQdIyzZF87Dapc\nJuBXoqxxwkEnu9PouhHXCrZ1jX1DivHFxejx7PK3CpoDdV6TYBuQOvrJAAGTDCls\nsrUuBgc2Z0AF4R2sAVeOH+hwhm7YFTIruideuOVB88MPhdB1qSyBq6fpdpzvhmq2\n+pyBiT3A3FApYrDv3JgP0W6Qx/5eOBf8eJ8hYsUlGzM3R3lS/na6IeqB2fUu7by3\naWdX9RghMMnMMJQUWM2L\n=3c9W\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree b791e896245677e245a6a2d39b49146531aaaf1c\nparent 0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1780115719 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780115719 -0400\n\nstyle(code): align multi-line tool output that indents every row (#3670)\n\nCommand output where every line carries the same leading indent — `git\nbranch -r` prefixes each branch with two spaces — rendered with the\nfirst line flush against the glyph gutter and the remaining lines\nindented, because the output was passed through `str.strip()`, which\nonly trims the first line's leading whitespace. The collapsed preview\nand the expanded view stripped at different points, so expanding \"fixed\"\nthe misalignment while the default preview stayed crooked.","verified_at":"2026-05-30T04:35:20Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/39a5298643fef09b992b0e967fea7521065b5fbb/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405"}]},{"sha":"0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDBiNTkxYWM2ZjFmMDY4NTg0NTg3ODhjMTM1ZTAwNzY2N2VjMjA0MDU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-30T04:24:08Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-30T04:24:08Z"},"message":"style(code): align wrapped tool output under the gutter glyph (#3669)\n\nLong tool-output lines that soft-wrapped rendered their continuation at\ncolumn 0, directly under the `⎿` marker, because the glyph and a\ntwo-space hanging indent were baked into the `Content` and only applied\nat explicit newline boundaries — soft-wrap points got nothing. Moving\nthe glyph into a fixed-width layout gutter lets the content widget own a\nsingle hanging indent that every wrapped line inherits.","tree":{"sha":"0112521adfbada6136d1c0e483d8e66e0299d44b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/0112521adfbada6136d1c0e483d8e66e0299d44b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGmZoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKG4QADERthlPEYEkbk46+iIYQOFE\nCFQclkMMh7mEsSAsAZc5F/sWK+bCIbVhJFLE6dxqQrtvqFbAoe7fDK/LPpXaiuR+\n9/g02D85cxuzqESqIu8tTAvnkyKca9W2Xl2gn2simDr5QtkCfUtClQ9RNe+q/qX8\nXCSTBCRG9fEvRKDfMBcQ05vDBNlqR2OjIwndtEpyXhbyfTy3llPNxM5e4OPuLeNk\nDluPROD55ez3fI0DrsSNuN7JTdmrn40JLTfWaN1b/68ddfhpbQMjuex5ikUs83Ao\n2T8t5N0vHG5glAgtBwoXVGK/c7VDi0sIp34Ssjuch0Jb5LE33inwEtuBWNrDJlt9\nWVVdGjX4JMFXpcThJ/umsoCVw0TDFQ3dgl8Gs/vzNx+y0eTxOhAafbAOxfdLxoof\n6g5BIC8yqg2+LbwZUAaU4KLl/FQUBVATStX71uEXr1ulypjkXxgTFfKcLrkZX9lE\nlKDjvXQgLDtvlNUovaVW3qBmtn2d3L7iwwEmJvv8+c7MQR38Zx6K2qRT7DEtKWGu\nh5MRP0a7P7Z7RbVac8TLHpEiW9VE1gMUjBMIwi2ATQF5TnZA4tlrBBbIEOfW6Cnz\n+8U6qIJXXecl0XaMxeRta599CfSMRrqS59URkyZqVytYppIvdyPvaN8TKuaywauI\nlgo00CS7MT9rWqKaR5em\n=S0Um\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 0112521adfbada6136d1c0e483d8e66e0299d44b\nparent 27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1780115048 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780115048 -0400\n\nstyle(code): align wrapped tool output under the gutter glyph (#3669)\n\nLong tool-output lines that soft-wrapped rendered their continuation at\ncolumn 0, directly under the `⎿` marker, because the glyph and a\ntwo-space hanging indent were baked into the `Content` and only applied\nat explicit newline boundaries — soft-wrap points got nothing. Moving\nthe glyph into a fixed-width layout gutter lets the content widget own a\nsingle hanging indent that every wrapped line inherits.","verified_at":"2026-05-30T04:24:08Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/0b591ac6f1f06858458788c135e007667ec20405/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8"}]},{"sha":"27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDI3ZTE5NDBhOTI0YWJmYzk5OTEyNmNmNDYwMjQwMDNmNDUzYmEwYzg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-30T04:20:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-30T04:20:31Z"},"message":"fix(code): reconstruct message counts for `DeltaChannel` threads from writes table (#3668)\n\nMessage counts in the thread list were returning 0 for threads using\nLangGraph's `DeltaChannel` for `messages`, because the latest checkpoint\nomits the full message list between periodic snapshots. The count is now\nreconstructed by replaying `messages` writes through `add_messages`,\nmatching how LangGraph rebuilds state on load.","tree":{"sha":"5272cd12003b9325a35f42233cd0839b9552243e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5272cd12003b9325a35f42233cd0839b9552243e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGmWPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAU4QAEGwUrmDxrHKcR7FIUBUJpb6\nRI1R6CCOyHStIrMEzoByyyrT6DPPGO+MQkRRs5WHjJgzEdgy49ZQjAnkBQmoPmzI\nhL1IYSRRvsvU4QcKsQt1X9TZMqiEyFJpSJMCfs43axhulG7W7UtStMFuIBIKDe7T\nnZCa/NWDoVFIwUvAYiPMZXjEPqqcO9LCKEGyRzAS0ej9nBEk4hia1ATEc724Ki2n\neNAI/ixWoTmfbK/Ds1fgIrf0u0KUr1t8JC1vX2XxuDGPn4j8/V2/UfvfyaeyOqJm\nME69fBhRS4gQiDsg5mk/FYj9IiFg8JA1kywxJ2FfL9C1BxNaTyBnfltoueVKprTW\n0nqxR+PX5gp/nuokynJNOoJOf03+x3Jg5sXRSboAjhuEGeReGxL4anCyA5/V0oC1\nSZsWOCbdkzhQGiGJ/BWSBbfTmBVqgD+ZteNF5OuBcMRO8GXYS2qBbIr+9GMEIrUl\n/IeQ8L8Kq5kk5jhefPuCFzlWcd+DN8hmD6ZTXdUxlgMHqGhVD8+Gx1bQkZC0e19A\nWhucK/HpLS2QcAnFioV1UKMg8Xg1K9Vm/Z2tqqV5AAAjEQu4b53rltd6l12orwp4\nQtOsDhqslaLhmjTVNm3Lug7o5SIPbmC+8p7ELIUMpFv/DgMPVwLxLKBeJCklTS1Y\nrmCyQSwdvAEpBVIc2bkG\n=mqMR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5272cd12003b9325a35f42233cd0839b9552243e\nparent 977e11006cfbd78fbaba4e7bb2a13acf6b788652\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1780114831 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780114831 +0000\n\nfix(code): reconstruct message counts for `DeltaChannel` threads from writes table (#3668)\n\nMessage counts in the thread list were returning 0 for threads using\nLangGraph's `DeltaChannel` for `messages`, because the latest checkpoint\nomits the full message list between periodic snapshots. The count is now\nreconstructed by replaying `messages` writes through `add_messages`,\nmatching how LangGraph rebuilds state on load.","verified_at":"2026-05-30T04:20:31Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/27e1940a924abfc999126cf46024003f453ba0c8/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}"