nTwo unrelated Textual lifecycle bugs hit together when reconnecting an\nMCP server mid-thread. The first surfaced as `Could not load history:\n... a widget already exists with that ID`; the second crashed the app\nwhen the user tried to select-copy the error toast itself.","tree":{"sha":"e97034804a73026b7ae11d4514a4226c60d53ceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/e97034804a73026b7ae11d4514a4226c60d53ceb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/6b9a3c051586c26c542e958849e952d08a4b5a88","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFy0MCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEAcQACNS6a6PyjaXO9JGudiQL5r3\nZX4fcBxU+4PnmlmD+UFH/SBO1cpe1hdoJOOll9tUo7HMisrOsA3TpiphY055nUsA\nWOpvZXTB7YPf+jTJZ0zPjXfujFCxiw9zrhWeET8wVW49qFWf/j3Y2bYrygXXqOyu\ngLQav/aCCzaUtg+tRksh9nly2sFY5LP/FinjEqP+whswyuj2sKqvJg0lxsMLaNnS\nhKxQWnScGs8gzJmlU6NxM4YT1xfDDmsAayZ1IbaBP+Vq7hUgEvgd8wbk1Z2XOY2V\nm1vvSvHyzF4xOGouK7fZNXqda5fSGBpzqqO4f1s377LNNUlTnkjOATxiLMyfhQWW\ns31a8TE7PY2+a1e5xt1XjjajB4g2n/TsT61Yu9P9RxnoqpnvMLp2t+5P7MUmuRXW\nppYHKiX3SHv5xf2pMdr22oEqED59s3ktcDPOSg52OVnCxwOj0lylyoFJ1l31Z9R4\nsx7zCz6z3xps17iUIsjBZ74ZchplQQs8HFQnmktxe6kG9mmKDs7BdrOAHM9d9c3w\nqs2yqzNZK4thHYAEFNRfS+5gqbxsE6L4Vh/Bf8wcWI0cZ90JvuZPRncGNJZQbvNo\nitl6iYCWL37IoWRzsMTy/9irjUnY5VeU5lyQK/45Zm/InJp0XW0rcMNaoifrEWRD\nzN8ZwUccZfIe7yQ3YJuV\n=7pt5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e97034804a73026b7ae11d4514a4226c60d53ceb\nparent 97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779903756 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779903756 -0400\n\nfix(code): prevent duplicate-id crash on MCP reconnect and clipboard `NoScreen` (#3632)\n\nTwo unrelated Textual lifecycle bugs hit together when reconnecting an\nMCP server mid-thread. The first surfaced as `Could not load history:\n... a widget already exists with that ID`; the second crashed the app\nwhen the user tried to select-copy the error toast itself.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T17:42:37Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6b9a3c051586c26c542e958849e952d08a4b5a88","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/6b9a3c051586c26c542e958849e952d08a4b5a88","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/6b9a3c051586c26c542e958849e952d08a4b5a88/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f"}]},{"sha":"97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDk3OTQ2ZWUwOWViMTY3YzYzZDhjMDdmOGJiMTE2ZjQwY2ZjOTYwM2Y","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T16:06:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T16:06:50Z"},"message":"fix(sdk,code): use `file_path` kwarg in `read_file` examples (#3630)\n\nCloses #3568\n\n---\n\nTool description and system-prompt examples for `read_file` showed the\nkwarg as `path` (`read_file(path, limit=100)`) while the underlying\n`ReadFileSchema` requires `file_path`. Frontier models tolerate the\ncontradiction by deferring to the schema; open-weight models (qwen3,\ngemma4) copy the example verbatim and every call fails with `file_path:\nField required`.\n\n## Changes\n- Rewrite the three text-mode example signatures in\n`READ_FILE_TOOL_DESCRIPTION` to `read_file(file_path=\"...\", …)`,\nmatching the multimodal example already present.\n- Update the workflow line in `SKILLS_SYSTEM_PROMPT`\n(`SkillsMiddleware`) to use `read_file(file_path=\"...\", limit=1000)`.\n- Apply the same fix to `deepagents-code`'s `system_prompt.md` and the\n`format_tool_display` docstring example.","tree":{"sha":"fd3d88fbf6015400ee86688ab8ea505f7f32827c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/fd3d88fbf6015400ee86688ab8ea505f7f32827c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFxaaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6yUQAHQKsTkC9gW9vRCT+7Kfih4N\nV+UhH8C7CWe3bbHWmP33XaB9mzDEp2KI0WUjQqnaTgpz8BwSYGkMJ6wlddhaNzBB\nrrUGNJ7AWueZlRVoXTKqz71EfEwcusPD+Ki21cz2cI31f3CNz7ZhM/tiaAKdEkhq\nhmORqmckoULdIqmtBjNuFvpnEsPyLQVH/1/9udVcFv//+ksHJO7/o8ixtdPQudRu\nG7u407KRsH5mFlyqkh2RxbGO5XS80wTrzbjLxvD441YHQ1vsxuDw3UcHxchQK3VN\nj+ugbNKlcvtr1+hQzUl8F/Uki9vIs6Yo9EfQ/2yClZKY3CVdeFsN0kg2VoW9NHfz\nMErRgcDmZ76DnJwCwbfH55rhjgj/6Lnyh/f3C8e3Nt88mphNt3uJxIxsZbT5QWz0\nb6eRSNwSsFJbNuxvDfPAiVAKTyAJWt/PopPJtVmdXvIo19106LWJPdpcEAiJS3T/\nZLpErs9/mepbcxjwjaH5NWZihWWiU9zUWhn0zI7JO8I2hYgyVlDbeYQYMCjDAJ8t\n/66kvo3kXze+z4/pz/bLuZZxAPrVgNBZyL+m8uElzT847prXWd2ZHrhY5ZJtp9XS\na5B32LKMkg3ITIx9RW3bojBfarHNqTBrKSeIvs28W2xlsl6zMApkAgcMoSVDuAkB\n/cKrKNJmIBNHKbxlQkUr\n=GezB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree fd3d88fbf6015400ee86688ab8ea505f7f32827c\nparent bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779898010 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779898010 -0400\n\nfix(sdk,code): use `file_path` kwarg in `read_file` examples (#3630)\n\nCloses #3568\n\n---\n\nTool description and system-prompt examples for `read_file` showed the\nkwarg as `path` (`read_file(path, limit=100)`) while the underlying\n`ReadFileSchema` requires `file_path`. Frontier models tolerate the\ncontradiction by deferring to the schema; open-weight models (qwen3,\ngemma4) copy the example verbatim and every call fails with `file_path:\nField required`.\n\n## Changes\n- Rewrite the three text-mode example signatures in\n`READ_FILE_TOOL_DESCRIPTION` to `read_file(file_path=\"...\", …)`,\nmatching the multimodal example already present.\n- Update the workflow line in `SKILLS_SYSTEM_PROMPT`\n(`SkillsMiddleware`) to use `read_file(file_path=\"...\", limit=1000)`.\n- Apply the same fix to `deepagents-code`'s `system_prompt.md` and the\n`format_tool_display` docstring example.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T16:06:51Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/97946ee09eb167c63d8c07f8bb116f40cfc9603f/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27"}]},{"sha":"bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGJiMjc2ZTJjNDExNzdiMGRmZTZmZmQ0NGZkMzdhMjkzZmJmZGNiMjc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T15:43:59Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T15:43:59Z"},"message":"fix(code): char-truncate execute tool preview output (#3627)\n\nThe `execute` tool widget previewed shell output by line count only, so\na single huge line (e.g., a JSON blob from `gh api graphql`) blew past\nthe preview budget and rendered in full with no \"click or Ctrl+O to\nexpand\" hint. `_format_shell_output` now also enforces the\n`_PREVIEW_CHARS` budget and clips a long line in place when needed.","tree":{"sha":"cac27a237de2ca1f50cd17eae804fe183d808eff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/cac27a237de2ca1f50cd17eae804fe183d808eff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFxE/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASNkQACPjuQVV6jP4mKiwD8+M48Q7\nVLV2/R7FpOeVyQiJyWcwPYQLggnlHHAGDzfMYOyykwTyaR6cHyNlYPSQHInOo1Sz\nkd7p9y0RygW/GLUsZBaxuQR913cBaGYEuWekOpdXRpHCSnr7KFAo0dany5uQfBTE\nBKwtlSxpJUylVIhRfPKn2h+XNrJ6scRx4E9TGsVqXfMSSOXFwqovaw8HfBy5mO8W\nRi6KSoQbeWqykeYq5tvmlzOEe/51ZBZAEh/xWYPiV+Hc8wjtjh+CBX3/9AogKYn0\nsazKofE13ejtsz68gpdpQ98odiflgKt2+xrlBRYn+OmyAk2Ml9Ib0oKcZjZXMEoI\nofmAeIV45JpnShYcGCMcQfzEv9OGJOGQE/xI1fW4qPjB/XFUD/X6M9mKVRkQ+d0Z\nH855/rMv//kRcOc2GICzQw+wTdoxd/cktj27hu4dZRfI75msseriYlFvv1VNSHp/\n0Qerqm7gY0HmHfKqFSVp3yVW3NPVqWy/NJRhhhn+0wf3s/qP+kpsCU8N4sW6eM4I\ntDXJGKqego4vbZf62I93EiNG13C8Izh3zKhWJiPlinkLqDxYmnra6Uz1ye8BiZe/\nmOCCWOS0lssQGPgUm/kGX1BGJgUDQiQ/YUoyjGIIejpP7dyQ5gL8YxWuC5DCKmcb\naL94bMdZZXJ1vjLrQ9T5\n=kZpx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree cac27a237de2ca1f50cd17eae804fe183d808eff\nparent 3b4b0867665e58959073e660d85b74c700acaa1e\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779896639 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779896639 -0400\n\nfix(code): char-truncate execute tool preview output (#3627)\n\nThe `execute` tool widget previewed shell output by line count only, so\na single huge line (e.g., a JSON blob from `gh api graphql`) blew past\nthe preview budget and rendered in full with no \"click or Ctrl+O to\nexpand\" hint. `_format_shell_output` now also enforces the\n`_PREVIEW_CHARS` budget and clips a long line in place when needed.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T15:44:00Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/bb276e2c41177b0dfe6ffd44fd37a293fbfdcb27/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","