thub.com","date":"2026-05-27T15:41:01Z"},"message":"fix(code): mention `Ctrl+R` in MCP reconnect toast (#3622)\n\n## Description\nUpdates the MCP server disable/re-enable toast to mention Ctrl+R as an\nalternative to `/mcp reconnect`, matching the viewer shortcut.\n\n## Release Note\nMCP reconnect toasts now mention the Ctrl+R shortcut.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] Verified the disabled-server toast copy includes Ctrl+R in the\nfocused unit test.\n\n_Opened collaboratively by Mason Daugherty and open-swe._\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <61371264+mdrxy@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e1d0c7b0d6fff6496d7a60906f310eeff4eb24d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/6e1d0c7b0d6fff6496d7a60906f310eeff4eb24d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3b4b0867665e58959073e660d85b74c700acaa1e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFxCNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATJgQAEqVuygV2bv+Q6kdppaqclhn\nJka70ElHronHs/WPXpO+12Q+LtSVbkkg6vNGrlTwBEP+YXct1HzZVE0b7wpPVgM6\nK2Eify4ke5oO9WkU67OaGQAA5c78pHE7Zk0G4uK5ESqAE6+m7FSPT8Bz6AvBtDzK\nJ6eRBhBGXgr5JdkMeSmClMJHfFXdxwME6VytxOimzMriWa0WF2VxtikCPua6gega\nREDRtUurJF3VBhWLI16KNgEbvsnBfp6WwxpmZUeP0KXlKXKwYXTvUbTerVkUgZYF\nFlcABgCWsQvKtdYGuvPF3dQbrQe2uw0iJOK1LlJe6oclrbF4AajtGEY3/Xivh2vq\nXtJ5QeVjZguR7EGsUmWpd/IAPATgoKiC4c6WLAcY9/aFbJsUwfYBZ2v+Nl3uUnUT\nJyHR0zUP+BYgOBVxVad/+jAwPo97WMT3ffMp/hPTz2SRFvgJ20I4jVetsIocCsE/\n3ICikqXDMAeeP5A/EAxSGc2oEH8FbgzHWVDnJiF/zpsHNyjn4n+bIodNGDgWMH1a\n7OtxzbxlBrlUYHSbC4mnnZ6U3JlmXA95xRuJBShA+FmSO1FKz0Y+adDHDBvp0H9v\nRB4H31ChzPyXioVvXjKQfAQWZuAO77h8zNHL4ndIEFWDhBtwUWxbUOenH6OgmV01\ns/0/A0SLLZmj1kwwTNaP\n=5rVz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 6e1d0c7b0d6fff6496d7a60906f310eeff4eb24d\nparent 1206fc3d494089733c64e321c59f71c62fc7835a\nauthor open-swe[bot] <215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1779896461 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779896461 -0400\n\nfix(code): mention `Ctrl+R` in MCP reconnect toast (#3622)\n\n## Description\nUpdates the MCP server disable/re-enable toast to mention Ctrl+R as an\nalternative to `/mcp reconnect`, matching the viewer shortcut.\n\n## Release Note\nMCP reconnect toasts now mention the Ctrl+R shortcut.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] Verified the disabled-server toast copy includes Ctrl+R in the\nfocused unit test.\n\n_Opened collaboratively by Mason Daugherty and open-swe._\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <61371264+mdrxy@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-05-27T15:41:02Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3b4b0867665e58959073e660d85b74c700acaa1e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3b4b0867665e58959073e660d85b74c700acaa1e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3b4b0867665e58959073e660d85b74c700acaa1e/comments","author":{"login":"open-swe[bot]","id":215916821,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODN6hFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1395372?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/open-swe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/open-swe%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.githu