.","tree":{"sha":"2a5c224018bf0c854e1820f8b897cf38f1c3558c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/2a5c224018bf0c854e1820f8b897cf38f1c3558c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/1206fc3d494089733c64e321c59f71c62fc7835a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFw5ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+hwQAB3P9AALfEYWGMvWbaZBIrb1\n3rkq1kkj6kALAKl4a80aXIvMdOXwf+3+g1zqb0kdlxsn3xKAitihzzfPaPG+ngHI\noh52eDxKSYVioCiAvraDV8KQkRIRJcRJ+eGv/cMbeFomk//Vq4IiE4TJhwvxbR62\ny6hYZ+uZH/k5BbT+VRCUQa36McWqkbckDPZPLVYCDxMOG0vfZ2/4D+DBSfcP0rm0\nponuDoQLzvNuxvp1mfEwBu1dogByQBidpTQhF9taBLk6sXZaDM7eQFJnjFLQhbQt\nyQrjpCXgurCzhvZvoX8W0rq72lc8Q+p1z0lLANIfwZna5J8Dxs1e/zzt2QH5vmua\naehbDTaMMIL1V68V3+ScufzcoiPSKV5amV3wIptLurWc2KOCV9i6MFpk1RTcBKPf\n/x/qWpbk4xC9YsaZ4ImCqFIM5oiH2zGUG/CTctpwl0g2AkoS4Q7YykrTesdlxjBc\niL+FNniYs2RwfTAyGRx3N1ryl15KsVl0MqBGAFtugew+tRXG3aKk736ABNOzLxzc\nrGsTJweSZByqHRoUIW1TvqmoV3kH2LIqx9zZ80xwAI6fMJnFCKf/LhbdkBupmhFq\nvK747ki8GoLkmFKWy67SxkzDc+6jJZgwMg+cncLWaVKiCse4kUhxbs7k+BT+4voP\n6Le3bs+VPGTHTtRWaxAy\n=Wg1x\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 2a5c224018bf0c854e1820f8b897cf38f1c3558c\nparent fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779895872 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779895872 -0400\n\nci(infra): auto-remove `waiting-on-author` label on author reply (#3626)\n\nAdds a small GitHub Actions workflow that clears the `waiting-on-author`\nlabel from an issue or PR as soon as the original author posts a\nfollow-up comment. Closes the manual loop where maintainers had to\nremember to strip the label after a reply landed.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T15:31:14Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/1206fc3d494089733c64e321c59f71c62fc7835a","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/1206fc3d494089733c64e321c59f71c62fc7835a","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/1206fc3d494089733c64e321c59f71c62fc7835a/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726"}]},{"sha":"fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGZkZjNkYjQ2NGNkOWYzZGU0ZTg0YzI0NjU0N2RkMjk3MWQyNmM3MjY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T15:05:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T15:05:03Z"},"message":"fix(code): render MCP tool errors and drop empty-string optional params (#3624)\n\nTwo small fixes for `dcode` tool failures. When an MCP tool raised a\n`ToolException` server-side, the UI surfaced `Agent error: {'error':\n'ToolException', 'message': 'An internal error occurred'}` as a raw\nPython dict repr — the redacted-payload shape that `langgraph_api` emits\nfor non-allowlisted exceptions. Separately, Slack's\n`slack_search_public_and_private` (and similar ID-shaped MCP params)\nrejected `context_channel_id=\"\"` with `\"value is not a channel ID\"`\nwhenever the model filled an optional string param with `\"\"` instead of\nomitting it.","tree":{"sha":"cc80ef9c9bc0925908665f5249ac446571d7387c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/cc80ef9c9bc0925908665f5249ac446571d7387c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFwgfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAau8QAGsZLisrg/nGp6UYwbGwWoM3\naXdcInKd+HjE/E7SdrvW1Np1rbqFFA9CCbihpQL496fSYPKrOrVGpJXM7DcmbP8g\nqI/mIBrBXk6BPI/7+HlMAfYHP9ZQgMlZr42LnZ2pcIcP6StDrGZHd1FLvZ7fEAev\nguZfqCM+owmQ33HWbPRnH6YUHck1hlbwfFwJ9/OGr1vdNs9cQpNI8SZMsOyPzHY0\n0CKaXc7jULx7ap4qUM02ctAk91hgwLn9oVe3kGRTALCgo+fz0a51HVB9dwvn0bKt\nRiVa4lAaLymCyRdtQUMl+edLqEI/UYzSrtzNaJB+cigtHTybGvRGJInER8cybWZE\nl04h2ip2spdV05omxn6KYBUU/QVCbXTNwCxjbJb075PtiY15GP3Bwa9DRSHemin+\nKCw+TtbWb4n5y0XhMVTkDfwPo8gVN4Pcoj/WWPikVN/bIDLVUDiPB+EO4O9pvqDU\nl4V7XEXqpNBuiMpkxRHJdsoeb50IUOq97SR1LR0V/G7SE2L5sTSbQD+AHT9CSc9X\nXyZRzV8Av1Pel0D6wCYNaIxzvefytFimHv9ajTnNtc8vwGuC6U2bnN7yF8v0I2eD\nbtB+77wwfsiwxhltPZvOVRxDDo59h0C9RhGumqxIzuhduiA9y1VecOT0a/OeLhxu\nD2gAj3JjVAfZgN/6vWSR\n=+b54\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree cc80ef9c9bc0925908665f5249ac446571d7387c\nparent 19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779894303 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779894303 -0400\n\nfix(code): render MCP tool errors and drop empty-string optional params (#3624)\n\nTwo small fixes for `dcode` tool failures. When an MCP tool raised a\n`ToolException` server-side, the UI surfaced `Agent error: {'error':\n'ToolException', 'message': 'An internal error occurred'}` as a raw\nPython dict repr — the redacted-payload shape that `langgraph_api` emits\nfor non-allowlisted exceptions. Separately, Slack's\n`slack_search_public_and_private` (and similar ID-shaped MCP params)\nrejected `context_channel_id=\"\"` with `\"value is not a channel ID\"`\nwhenever the model filled an optional string param with `\"\"` instead of\nomitting it.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T15:05:04Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/fdf3db464cd9f3de4e84c246547dd2971d26c726/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477"}]},{"sha":"19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDE5Y2Q2NzZiMTc3MjVlNTZmYWM3OWYxMmEwMTE2OGJhNzdhMzM0Nzc","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-05-27T14:20:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T14:20:12Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-code): 0.1.6 (#3607)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.6](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.5...deepagents-code==0.1.6)\n(2026-05-27)\n\n### Features\n\n* `/install` optional extras\n([#3606](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3606))\n([7ffaa93](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5))\n* Surface deferred MCP reconnect state in `/mcp`\n([#3612](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3612))\n([d8205c2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8))\n* Surface MCP servers awaiting reconnect on splash banner\n([#3615](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3615))\n([24c5258](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/24c5258ae6664bc3d3875d8065038716f7c86161))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Cancel server-side runs before re-trying interrupted-state writes\n([#3611](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3611))\n([7d46357](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547))\n* Editable-install guidance for adding extras\n([#3610](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3610))\n([771e55f](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9))\n* Reuse persisted DCR loopback port across OAuth launches\n([#3613](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3613))\n([f2f7471](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f2f747104945ac79b68e6524d6da886f7cfeb1b0))\n* Polish MCP auth success UX\n([#3614](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3614))\n([d225cb4](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d225cb41f41a0a9b2876aff2443eaa0ada24bf29))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","tree":{"sha":"52ededba0db2530cb20ba27bbdff241554db056c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/52ededba0db2530cb20ba27bbdff241554db056c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFv2cCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA84QAAcZXDkv15z41CnVs4Gp0Gyo\nha5uHvbq3JCHfT6alcHZo5GzVXOXEogMYgrTR2Ee78Rm2p0cD/74ac2B5gUw7t5g\n7g+38xWAbs6ocoU2vFhiccQvYpccsmVNDp8LYB0v2eqt+3Gs/+GjUx2PReoq7iKY\nB3UqfwJ6FIq9eqIKUwEXegaS6KZqhZm6kIfTESpm0GuTsJseP0Gu1kVFPPk1UMoV\niXhCvtyMO0m3EBRjG7mlCfipi15su63C4hoJypVMq6//SYBaKh3WemTc4EmtiO1P\noeGiyA5qCyVGNHOGuVnqA1n9M1aaNYuxJkI1mTHP9nmVFK1tYg3soYgscmuQNYEB\nSA/kqR1xQugyiD3cGW5nFPZ7QnsCUCPa18oDv99p/AR5GunY6o1LaoDbRAYZpjlP\nnJWFeRoQs0eJ69tQtG9hhNPSLlDcJ72fveMKQiDdXQcLn3AivBiD+DIZlShxfg9A\neZlwoUvIvoAwFjQxw1PM7JVVseF5O6SopQtMC4C6413ZFiaelQnQX70Ofk/ybEeP\nnfYNRpXNNytmQwj6uMLiqRxMsnxwfvKzu16nGu6DNtgoXvf7jViNX81p2wDtzq20\nfRZu4/b8i04MvTKAtUNAJ2vhDj7VhZRNrGMQ3YDe782jzh3lgcVIOAXF0zc9Z9di\nzm9AG/T3B3hS6jK60lNf\n=+HRJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 52ededba0db2530cb20ba27bbdff241554db056c\nparent 24c5258ae6664bc3d3875d8065038716f7c86161\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1779891612 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779891612 -0400\n\nrelease(deepagents-code): 0.1.6 (#3607)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Everything below this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.6](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.5...deepagents-code==0.1.6)\n(2026-05-27)\n\n### Features\n\n* `/install` optional extras\n([#3606](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3606))\n([7ffaa93](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5))\n* Surface deferred MCP reconnect state in `/mcp`\n([#3612](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3612))\n([d8205c2](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8))\n* Surface MCP servers awaiting reconnect on splash banner\n([#3615](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3615))\n([24c5258](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/24c5258ae6664bc3d3875d8065038716f7c86161))\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* Cancel server-side runs before re-trying interrupted-state writes\n([#3611](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3611))\n([7d46357](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547))\n* Editable-install guidance for adding extras\n([#3610](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3610))\n([771e55f](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9))\n* Reuse persisted DCR loopback port across OAuth launches\n([#3613](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3613))\n([f2f7471](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f2f747104945ac79b68e6524d6da886f7cfeb1b0))\n* Polish MCP auth success UX\n([#3614](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/3614))\n([d225cb4](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d225cb41f41a0a9b2876aff2443eaa0ada24bf29))\n\n---\n\n_Everything above this line will be the GitHub release body._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>","verified_at":"2026-05-27T14:20:13Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/19cd676b17725e56fac79f12a01168ba77a33477/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.