econnect\"` (PR #3612), but the splash banner only\ncounted `unauthenticated` and `error` — so the \"N MCP servers need\nlogin\" line decremented with nothing replacing it, even though the\nserver still can't be used until `/mcp reconnect` runs. Adds a third\ncounter so the user sees what they need to do next.","tree":{"sha":"577227317b101794832ca1d28a9d9c78504b6c10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/577227317b101794832ca1d28a9d9c78504b6c10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/24c5258ae6664bc3d3875d8065038716f7c86161","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFmioCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjxoQAF6zs54oFM5opdyHzwfbF1+b\nZKZhKvJpFpwBt5tdrlMlTmEARCJ8qIDB6Rq77JG0Rm7WGER+yLUOl7XzWJztiCai\nHsSbJf48Ike+UFrTwji1C70UC0Zg6YYZWTOfGgV1Svo78goOmPOKgsccuciOEnpW\nzHY5hWm9f3FrWtDONHtjAqOjho2mfM79JfZ5xdbVszWEP6MXLQ9euNAYjnQ0JP1X\n0c1EIoGsdtl234ZAv9PNvSoqle4kJqs5E1dMcMOzoFbeAlHCrQPohMQ0gn/N7vxV\n1XZvrPU2FdyYyhmTXLPD4DuX0vczJjmaMGgk/X5PkshUtkIjt9P8esxQgaLbxPGe\n1NOvekISncAKTdOj+kpEwqaIzgYLlL4Am3Ymx5w2R8oIgVACjttJZVzeZb1KvI6z\nurxiJfNUZcdNmQ/lX3MYMs4BVwGW0YLcCdvLAOPEb3y77CnpnK3OGPUMtXcn8q8D\nMSHDT5MkYfHl3zcDj63xXR/+MqgH32StwmIXdVeHzQCcPMJQrIFb6xB7gSFN94h8\nflGvBz1Dzc3t1/TxfvS5luCEx8CUg4IoEn6ng1xj7sZhBiCbOhyz+QKWAuoN7ozg\nHM4jFt94OI1f1Vxey1FevnxFjPv4wtFGdpIqi1VjvO+kiE2/AQbPsoEuGjJVFDiV\nPjXC0i4CXR0iFnOy4BCe\n=fQee\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 577227317b101794832ca1d28a9d9c78504b6c10\nparent d225cb41f41a0a9b2876aff2443eaa0ada24bf29\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779853480 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779853480 +0000\n\nfeat(code): surface MCP servers awaiting reconnect on splash banner (#3615)\n\nAfter a deferred `/mcp login`, the affected server flips to\n`status=\"awaiting_reconnect\"` (PR #3612), but the splash banner only\ncounted `unauthenticated` and `error` — so the \"N MCP servers need\nlogin\" line decremented with nothing replacing it, even though the\nserver still can't be used until `/mcp reconnect` runs. Adds a third\ncounter so the user sees what they need to do next.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T03:44:40Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/24c5258ae6664bc3d3875d8065038716f7c86161","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/24c5258ae6664bc3d3875d8065038716f7c86161","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/24c5258ae6664bc3d3875d8065038716f7c86161/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo