n a second launch, a fresh\nrandom loopback port would change the `redirect_uri`, causing the\nauthorize request to be rejected. `FileTokenStorage` now recovers the\npreviously registered port and reuses it for the callback server,\nkeeping the DCR registration valid across runs.","tree":{"sha":"383ead1ef407e7d31f514618a317691dcbbf98c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/383ead1ef407e7d31f514618a317691dcbbf98c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f2f747104945ac79b68e6524d6da886f7cfeb1b0","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFmDuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAguEQAFqM3omL1BAssELm3Jp19f9P\nhIHjA9eOoGuR7pMSRx3R2RK8Po2dtWJnPGTyNWbhU4i1mIAdzmt1RMbEHWPbeFAo\nUOXq5ImSAYhF22RCIANvkH2eiiJFp5kanFksyzzMFplFdd9dt1gYN17I4QJQVpdg\nnbHdEnFY31j0xqtoOUXhvvz6HK3zbPlwa0G21VUZWbQBfgwmwDspbn085z+gN7Ut\nHLkAiA2Yd3iuf9cJqlYQ7Hqi/oFWAgkE4lFbGyWVIgqq3dXBTkRao8fH3V5r5FPc\neOmhxWXVvojIS9sE2+jzXCFxaZkzlqKh1/Y4ibmgkPndqCcy0zLe5dekMW4IEaPn\nIJnNgvlvEtdZ0Vy/yFcwQbOfPJ3pNN0WEsIr/nSxcgKTdvWzQALuoZc4KXilX6pc\nJqzmEFH+idJ+PrwcJoa/vNeva93f5zczNGp4z3DXujFlOME0miTWr0s7u2rexxyK\nxH1ZQVDmtOyJBFdhV0wdl9vBzbYx31gJI+mdIN0kr/o7dl5dOZfL/SyTWUq50Q1b\n1BJ8o3BGMDZtkk0hV4MdbLo1uZ3ypHSCyL1LM90Bx2f2EXDqbk1860Dac1xnRawW\nKQYhaH5kynvGc6njDgpk+IyDQQaGJfMfITsc+b+vPWqtu8NjTlMfPBx7A3KhyvYY\nWSTSsB7vK6TzKX3IOhSb\n=D9XX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 383ead1ef407e7d31f514618a317691dcbbf98c9\nparent d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779851502 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779851502 -0400\n\nfix(code): reuse persisted DCR loopback port across OAuth launches (#3613)\n\nAfter DCR (dynamic client registration), the authorization server binds\n`client_id` to a specific `redirect_uri`. On a second launch, a fresh\nrandom loopback port would change the `redirect_uri`, causing the\nauthorize request to be rejected. `FileTokenStorage` now recovers the\npreviously registered port and reuses it for the callback server,\nkeeping the DCR registration valid across runs.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T03:11:42Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f2f747104945ac79b68e6524d6da886f7cfeb1b0","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f2f747104945ac79b68e6524d6da886f7cfeb1b0","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f2f747104945ac79b68e6524d6da886f7cfeb1b0/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8"}]},{"sha":"d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGQ4MjA1YzJhMzlkMDBlOGI2ZjdmNzBhZmU3Y2M5YmI5MmZlZTQyZDg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T02:48:38Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T02:48:38Z"},"message":"feat(code): surface deferred MCP reconnect state in `/mcp` (#3612)\n\nAfter OAuth login completes, the running LangGraph server still holds\nthe pre-login tool set until `/mcp reconnect`. Until now `/mcp` kept\nshowing those servers as `unauthenticated`, which read as a failed\nlogin. A new `awaiting_reconnect` state captures the in-between, with a\ndistinct glyph and a \"ready to load\" label that points at the reconnect\nchord.","tree":{"sha":"42a3420e152341d4c5c023f6f490d4702b20158e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/42a3420e152341d4c5c023f6f490d4702b20158e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFluGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9dQQAH5T6uEPxad7/OTP3F0UTW7N\npBqi37HuJO1A8A6sxWep4vKJQipNGNrubGBfoqSpwJ6Q8jwCnGnYWcSfutzGjv3X\nBwHaK4eEX2mDqOzsQYHMn5N2CBYOAQ2pGcp0G4i0uxiqn9hp7ykaMvOMSK+T6cUO\ngDwVe0RslYLpjqLTtaDYAHlHWhnHFqjfzY7tGR5Vp2Op4iUX/fMz3kRWjenrPnNU\nz5tjIQupmbuJh/5RQbXEpv4fB7RXzSO5jFWwmBYTp6nrpxrnz86J/FA9uJ6VqBOJ\nlWrA5dFFd1hy2sNhqNUHuMvJ/zpMOxNotgJrJjQXaoM//u6PrPRC0J4xOuIREDbm\nMYWlEZRrbj3rhSg7EyWV8gnHIwTauNoBmi03+Cr5iv5AQCqBnrIKVlrupx2hN68r\n2ZuC3eA1CfAbwsVE7ErtXsHygGNf7pvf7XOOjUr+GIowRLhzqpRl4BieVImHsLb5\nKh49MtR+HhQI3vvHLUMEhk+ievtZN8mXwAPhxZLreSN0rmdtDtK1iWm2KwPHdn0W\njsrDMnCcQ4AQM6FLQTe9biGasifpFG8XZN4TBU20YTNEhBh+O4ShkJaLoAENw+mp\nwyG104hnDPfycqgNMQf4F6eFWIX5epzusK4Mr6Ifx5a9vA6PmhD4m0dmGa5ZcNDN\nztsOrUwbfvb1MJHYjmfx\n=aQEY\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 42a3420e152341d4c5c023f6f490d4702b20158e\nparent 771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779850118 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779850118 -0400\n\nfeat(code): surface deferred MCP reconnect state in `/mcp` (#3612)\n\nAfter OAuth login completes, the running LangGraph server still holds\nthe pre-login tool set until `/mcp reconnect`. Until now `/mcp` kept\nshowing those servers as `unauthenticated`, which read as a failed\nlogin. A new `awaiting_reconnect` state captures the in-between, with a\ndistinct glyph and a \"ready to load\" label that points at the reconnect\nchord.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T02:48:39Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/d8205c2a39d00e8b6f7f70afe7cc9bb92fee42d8/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9"}]},{"sha":"771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDc3MWU1NWYxNzFiODA4N2I4NzZlY2Y3NjdkMmYyM2M4NmMyYTI3Yjk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T02:01:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T02:01:03Z"},"message":"fix(code): editable-install guidance for adding extras (#3610)\n\nCorrect misleading recovery hints for users on an editable `uv tool\ninstall -e …` setup who try to add an optional extra. The old text told\nthem to `uv sync --extra <name>` from the source directory, which only\ntouches the source `.venv` — never the tool environment that `dcode`\nactually runs from. Also fixes a Rich markup bug where the literal\n`[quickjs]` in the hint was parsed as a style tag and stripped from\noutput.","tree":{"sha":"3c298ee0c59aed5e1d3cb62a753e0f2c79c00d83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/3c298ee0c59aed5e1d3cb62a753e0f2c79c00d83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFlBfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAojgQAJDoXCFpQDEelO4yD6uI/UCX\n8eJ5iGidqbljq5HzLm2xLYeiOSJnx0JecT02hnAYQ7eygdphbP4DqP7cp0JG9EA8\nTLhvS3WqP4M9mq1zO3NxVh3glMYjgQx0GPGLMaoetNGzRpwB8frnqv4gjj3F6xV/\nouzwjWtcE1cfZLoFrMpRdz4s0q/YF5BYpsYjxTa3cIf2tZJ9ficoKqCwjP0C4Jdt\nzfztZBX/ysfxPU5njOMYSMJvUMJRtdSpsqyHkPMK9aX1iPKGxvZx+WNITcCciYt0\nhqflMmHjOyK0xRDCf5A/iSnZ74tyA17GlumV/YrdYjYlH6WJ1WYdIIpp/WhO6CwY\nEx0KnmzJvgbvL5yW+wQ7OcO51HUYZAsrP1TFYlqm8W4KLVwUK6dDck8f7hw7smnx\nDRFwJ7eLkGUgFglAXjSo4ZSgy6IsHowudvbcNkvWiv0O9feuY0Bkkd7o9GEsicdc\neh3OtlK/8VOEKfW180VBLAN5H3YL2nazcYox560E1hrRpqkn91r/f0Mh20Snu6FJ\nR5di/fjZQ2XYfOQEUgkINX7cqx6S8+AI2blQtY6hNWyfG5fTDVa5ugual3R1k8KP\nn4rDrOHeTDWSc3AbdHF5cTKuhrMrq4EL7MuuUudtRgmuWDbIqB9YP6G0jlGaOnZ3\np0jd11pdJ6rAGeGhh1XN\n=nDRu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 3c298ee0c59aed5e1d3cb62a753e0f2c79c00d83\nparent 7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779847263 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779847263 -0400\n\nfix(code): editable-install guidance for adding extras (#3610)\n\nCorrect misleading recovery hints for users on an editable `uv tool\ninstall -e …` setup who try to add an optional extra. The old text told\nthem to `uv sync --extra <name>` from the source directory, which only\ntouches the source `.venv` — never the tool environment that `dcode`\nactually runs from. Also fixes a Rich markup bug where the literal\n`[quickjs]` in the hint was parsed as a style tag and stripped from\noutput.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T02:01:03Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/771e55f171b8087b876ecf767d2f23c86c2a27b9/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547"}]},{"sha":"7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDdkNDYzNTdjNTQ0NmJiYzYyMjVmOTcyZmQ2NmRjNTJhZjhkZDA1NDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T01:57:48Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T01:57:48Z"},"message":"fix(code): cancel server-side runs before re-trying interrupted-state writes (#3611)\n\nWhen a user hits `Esc` while connected to a remote LangGraph agent, the\nlocal SSE stream closes but the server-side run keeps executing. The\nfollow-up `aupdate_state` POST then returned HTTP 409 and surfaced\n*\"Could not save interrupted state (ConflictError). Subsequent turns may\nsee stale state.\"* in the chat. Now the client cancels in-flight runs\nserver-side before retrying the state write, so the partial AI message +\ncancellation marker land cleanly and the next turn starts with the right\ncontext.","tree":{"sha":"1c5bf243bc83f03d22b9338daed2ea232e5e5869","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/1c5bf243bc83f03d22b9338daed2ea232e5e5869"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFk+cCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPrEQADhUK76AJZheIKOoW+xa77Co\ntQ7KIiuJ2S6dUZsg5bEiNsyTq3s6ZR8sH/dV+ZljagEdAWBPSxjyjuOrn7MUoIw3\nqO0p/hanbhS2VxU+7MdPBdd5u1qUfB25VEI2hkklVKGSuDqQ+MsdAo65gwBYyTqp\needX4khFSW9z2/7SqDpFPpo9gOHzR+3Wkzvx46yo1K9Bpbk+aNCUNsy8/B99hkqG\nN+UzVdg2xm1GUrsPjO6cMYeAvoKId6lnw/0qsWVrz2/AFcGDXr/LbCSVk+a3pV0D\n9zKTw3CMMXOhk4Ix2FEPoO1ktp5KgpReYBOlf6td/H5MJSqgCmb/jT7c+0LcF/Ml\nQqJBcl+wd3on+FWAIwPaAOoj+Nghoyr4JybQ/dVfutMtwV1/GyurADquSld78rl9\nJe2ZMCPtcAP82Z2oLr4BaWX3W8Vm5077M7e7YOLn2+OUFvY58Jz5S640D6lfE2wF\nciD81iPOPL3Hv78fLVADLxfhE7m2XeWNx9pM0j45q6fSu0oarw1pArAkEvgMrnzT\nIGzo5dgHp2GJmzD2QCmdf7P1XxrQVlb6I7XAw3Z8+FSjBGwpcHKYAsadSde2dwBI\nDT/gjlVZrWS9BRi+VKEe1plgNoPbdzrwkmauZu5jnLS7L6olwEF3uxnuAM5WP3ib\nKmHzhc+Z7ss8FLvC9WgE\n=nRuJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1c5bf243bc83f03d22b9338daed2ea232e5e5869\nparent f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779847068 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779847068 -0400\n\nfix(code): cancel server-side runs before re-trying interrupted-state writes (#3611)\n\nWhen a user hits `Esc` while connected to a remote LangGraph agent, the\nlocal SSE stream closes but the server-side run keeps executing. The\nfollow-up `aupdate_state` POST then returned HTTP 409 and surfaced\n*\"Could not save interrupted state (ConflictError). Subsequent turns may\nsee stale state.\"* in the chat. Now the client cancels in-flight runs\nserver-side before retrying the state write, so the partial AI message +\ncancellation marker land cleanly and the next turn starts with the right\ncontext.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T01:57:48Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7d46357c5446bbc6225f972fd66dc52af8dd0547/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9"}]},{"sha":"f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGY3NGViZWYxZjJhODU4MGExZWMwMWRmYzk5NWQ4MjRlNDIyYzVlYjk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T01:23:53Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T01:23:53Z"},"message":"chore(code): pin `FilesystemBackend`'s `virtual_mode=False` (#3608)\n\nPin every `deepagents-code` instantiation of `FilesystemBackend` to\n`virtual_mode=False` so the CLI keeps its current real-filesystem\nsemantics when the SDK flips the default. Also silences the pending\n`DeprecationWarning` the SDK now emits when `virtual_mode` is left\nunset.","tree":{"sha":"5f5f27e90a90a7453cf456fa3403f731accf4bcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/5f5f27e90a90a7453cf456fa3403f731accf4bcd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFkepCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2ckQAIIwnqBcmg+otNiFQYr2qBwB\nXBE5h2F1HEoUXcru0I6axBdlHuDFFfnkW6BBYNnew0To0OLfvg4MzE09APQY8oCg\n7uxYoCcg2Ov7Ag6h350kxd4pVR8GL4NWNc9nouk0/1ql/5WqSypzh9VDIMSGAq8j\n41Av3iLklxWIGsNkJnXQUtKFXB32ICtf+nHK8JkK9FsW7I7NKveMP84XcQY+LrP4\nzkMThww+Fy+NkhoSDG70wXjyMYS/KJPpbwLisCCAEQ85Z9RftCcT8QKBQCWNxpcf\nRr7X+3PHO8dUxiP5+jQYDg8mf0xwAHwkCqZFOZIhk7rIBHPfkqH5dOq9qMUxegiG\nmvsFo9hHTmASyZK3fXvRZp1XEsxxb97xi3WYqZkGreYbuyOWXKDKcK0MXV9y/4Yn\nATZ59t48CGvoqE648h3HlK65O2MxeJXqIZrnpusly8h+dp9om6mgy/QkkoUmFsma\nnXjIwW9wef2TCU/xFmEo02DcHimCrh4o9JdVeDJxph+oORxhWphYSI1tgJVDVveE\nzzpLcvdERl2ey91dHUiU0Bg95NqoNWF9pICGbgDit6vLec2jwiSOPe7ppG5tmNWX\nRTFS/zxw91xejmamgLVm14GNOJOnIy7NpggSjvPXyRwhxGHcQN+ZHXD8V1/L8rJZ\nUtlmSRCBdz8ckMv6dWrG\n=fQ5u\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5f5f27e90a90a7453cf456fa3403f731accf4bcd\nparent 7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779845033 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779845033 +0000\n\nchore(code): pin `FilesystemBackend`'s `virtual_mode=False` (#3608)\n\nPin every `deepagents-code` instantiation of `FilesystemBackend` to\n`virtual_mode=False` so the CLI keeps its current real-filesystem\nsemantics when the SDK flips the default. Also silences the pending\n`DeprecationWarning` the SDK now emits when `virtual_mode` is left\nunset.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T01:23:53Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/f74ebef1f2a8580a1ec01dfc995d824e422c5eb9/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5"}]},{"sha":"7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDdmZmFhOTNkY2E2OTEwY2Q0NTQwNDBkNDE2ZmY3ZTBlOGJjYmNlYTU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T00:49:25Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T00:49:25Z"},"message":"feat(code): `/install` optional extras (#3606)\n\nAdds a first-class way to install optional extras into an existing\n`dcode` install without dropping back to a shell or guessing package\nnames. Surfaces it as both the `/install <extra>` slash command (in-app)\nand a `dcode --install EXTRA` headless flag, and rewrites the ecosystem\nof `pip install …` recovery hints to point at the new flow.","tree":{"sha":"922927c9498a84ba496e2cbfe16d2a9791a71909","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/922927c9498a84ba496e2cbfe16d2a9791a71909"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFj+VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgCgQABTsD3iG+mPqBn2k5XMwSFTm\n6qtdfNZ+yiqk9JvQYF3DhJInvn51zCeV/bNYFEt3afFToDbDrk+DXMIz3biBJ8Yy\nUo7clwVLH/ho7GyRWsVzlMBDLGXK6yF0M6+PjVezCfWYqtAvK0CceLnbf7cIVjwN\n0r4JVGMKOvuYZh4nOMDd+v5nrUxkWmxfjMdXFWYgEjQJuANdC815/RS4MM0QMrHa\nFljoZFFuO9s5gm+nywUHGnegB5Zl+zEGbrcMjugtj7G7m2HDY7MNXhQ1y5hZZW9x\nPU5buDBYf/CY12lBA5nXKt3Q2CdXJ4jaP1J0+GnZRrlHVQEXsTmN7xPTxu8BtO7S\nqvfcK+dEo8Y5BGwec+kJQI5IOhf1sIu0e/25sRb9WOI3eRtq/+pcRu4zC6SewDpS\n5SXL738Y18ofmaZXTMdSIzWbgjpH5sSUMCMzGPwrqapJmh+f2BF5wMJ1xAopssG5\nKVCk2/BEAP7lRIP6VIX6Q5L2BQJleCJEYFVKN66Br7zmfwDgjKdiJ20q/uYSbGKL\n4ZaCg8WinzpOvb54SWeYW+o8kYPIgXei2Q6jO6NFL+0EsAsfnwCQoEBawh3j/R4t\nFtlVyvK1wdI79sONRw2M3pfwwA6n5X3erNLxreFwiJ+h6Zuto2bJnHUfGFznXmMs\nnI1sahv0Adf5Qw7KZXZW\n=1vzo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 922927c9498a84ba496e2cbfe16d2a9791a71909\nparent 61f7753b8de197486b901fc59f275c2dafd85dd7\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1779842965 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779842965 -0400\n\nfeat(code): `/install` optional extras (#3606)\n\nAdds a first-class way to install optional extras into an existing\n`dcode` install without dropping back to a shell or guessing package\nnames. Surfaces it as both the `/install <extra>` slash command (in-app)\nand a `dcode --install EXTRA` headless flag, and rewrites the ecosystem\nof `pip install …` recovery hints to point at the new flow.","verified_at":"2026-05-27T00:49:26Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/7ffaa93dca6910cd454040d416ff7e0e8bcbcea5/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo